-- Seed data for pricing_data, generated from the legacy scale-army-pricing-calculator's
-- data/policies.json (3444 role/seniority/region rows). Regenerated ids as
-- slug(role)_senCode(seniority)_slug(region) since a handful of the original ids collided
-- across different roles (a bug in the source data's id scheme, not ours).
--
-- Safe to re-run: upserts on id conflict rather than erroring or duplicating.
-- Run with: npm run db:seed-pricing --workspace web  (see web/db/migrate.mjs's sibling script)


on conflict (id) do update set
  pod = excluded.pod,
  role = excluded.role,
  family = excluded.family,
  seniority = excluded.seniority,
  region = excluded.region,
  salary = excluded.salary,
  gm_floor = excluded.gm_floor,
  target_price = excluded.target_price,
  min_margin = excluded.min_margin,
  skills = excluded.skills;
